     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Residence and nationalities",
     "texto": [
      "To say the street where you live, people usually say «Ik woon op...» or «in de...» followed by the name of the street and the number. In the Netherlands the house number is always written after the street name («Marktstraat 12»). Nationalities and language names always begin with a capital letter in Dutch: «Spaans», «Nederlands»."
     ],
